WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
 Good afternoon and thank you for being with us today at the Athenea de Manila University.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:16.000
 I am Matak Villanueva on behalf of the university. I would like to thank the members of the media for joining us as we continue

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:25.000
 to grieve the loss of our student athletes Renechler, Bobet, Bartibuah, Batirbunya and Divine Adil.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:32.000
 We have gathered today to address this tragedy, share the steps the university has taken in response

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:38.000
 and discuss the measures now being undertaken in pursuit of truth, accountability and healing.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:47.000
 Before we begin, may I ask everyone to stand up to observe a moment of silence for Bobet and Divine.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:01:01.810
 Thank you. You may now take your seats.

00:01:01.810 --> 00:01:09.810
 As we proceed, we respectfully ask everyone to keep in mind that this tragedy involves grieving families,

00:01:09.810 --> 00:01:16.810
 teammates, coaches and members of our community who continue to struggle with this loss.

00:01:16.810 --> 00:01:25.810
 We therefore ask all questions to be asked respectfully in a manner consistent with the seriousness of this occasion.

00:01:25.810 --> 00:01:28.810
 A few reminders before we begin.

00:01:28.810 --> 00:01:38.810
 First, some matters remain under the review of the university's independent fact-finding inquiry as well as by competent authorities.

00:01:38.810 --> 00:01:49.150
 Questions that would require speculation or prejudge the outcome of these processes may not be answered.

00:01:49.150 --> 00:01:58.150
 Second, out of respect for the privacy and welfare of the families, we will not discuss confidential personal matters.

00:01:58.150 --> 00:02:08.150
 Third, we ask that questions be limited to matters directly related to today's statement and university's response to the tragedy.

00:02:08.150 --> 00:02:16.750
 Fourth, out of respect for the families and for the integrity of these proceedings,

00:02:16.750 --> 00:02:33.930
 we ask that there be no live streaming or live broadcasting of today's briefing without the prior approval of the university.

00:02:33.930 --> 00:02:39.930
 We will make available official statement and relevant materials following this program.

00:02:39.930 --> 00:02:43.930
 We appreciate your cooperation and understanding.

00:02:43.930 --> 00:03:00.340
 Joining Father Yap this afternoon are Father Arbihi Son, Director for Alumni Affairs,

00:03:00.340 --> 00:03:12.340
 Attorneys Krishna Santos and Joseph de Jesus who will be available to help address questions related to the university's response and ongoing efforts.

00:03:12.340 --> 00:03:21.340
 At this time, I will ask Ateneo de Milo University President, Roberto C. Yap, SJ, to deliver the university's statement.

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:31.370
 Father Babi.

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:36.370
 Members of the media, colleagues and the Ateneo community.

00:03:36.370 --> 00:03:40.370
 We face you today with heavy hearts.

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:48.830
 Speaking from a landscape of deep and profound pain and sorrow.

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:57.830
 One week ago on June 8th, 2026, our community was shattered by a tragedy that claimed the lives of our student athletes,

00:03:57.830 --> 00:04:04.039
 Reneba Therbonia and Divine Adili.

00:04:04.039 --> 00:04:10.039
 No word in any language is capable of describing this loss.

00:04:10.039 --> 00:04:16.040
 When a young man dies, we mourn the loss of life and the shattering of dreams.

00:04:16.040 --> 00:04:21.290
 We mourn the potential that won't come true.

00:04:21.290 --> 00:04:32.290
 The empty chairs at family dinner tables and the futures that were supposed to unfold in our playing courts and far beyond them.

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:37.290
 To the families of Rene and Divine, we see you.

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:40.660
 We hear you.

00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:43.660
 We acknowledge the unbearable pain of your mourning.

00:04:43.660 --> 00:04:57.389
 We know that the grief you carry right now is compounded by an anger that is entirely natural, justified and deeply human.

00:04:57.389 --> 00:05:11.050
 On behalf of Ateneo de Milo University, I am here to say simply and directly, we are truly deeply sorry.

00:05:11.050 --> 00:05:19.050
 We apologize unreservedly to the families and to our entire community for the agonizing pain of this tragedy.

00:05:19.050 --> 00:05:28.389
 Two young men entrusted to our care did not return home and that fact breaks our hearts.

00:05:28.389 --> 00:05:33.389
 No explanation, context or words can undo that loss.

00:05:33.389 --> 00:05:41.389
 We face this moment with absolute humility and we ask for your prayers and your forgiveness.

00:05:41.389 --> 00:05:54.769
 After the incident, the university chose direct involved action for the families and the members of the team and we continue to do so.

00:05:54.769 --> 00:06:01.769
 The few public updates were not because we did not care for the bereaved families.

00:06:01.769 --> 00:06:14.769
 We believe and continue to believe that public relations or institutional noise should not intrude upon a family's grief.

00:06:14.769 --> 00:06:23.769
 We are truly sorry for not being quick at informing the public of the developments which has led to perceptions of inaction.

00:06:23.769 --> 00:06:31.769
 We focused on being present for the grieving families in their darkest hour.

00:06:31.769 --> 00:06:47.769
 We ask that you understand that while we do want the truth to come out, the persons who can shed light on the events of June 8 are also now subject of investigations by the authorities.

00:06:47.769 --> 00:06:56.769
 We recognize that they have their constitutional rights as well and we intend on respecting those rights.

00:06:56.769 --> 00:07:03.769
 And therefore we cannot speak on their behalf nor force them to speak at this time.

00:07:03.769 --> 00:07:09.769
 Also, like everyone else, the law affords Ateneo certain rights.

00:07:09.769 --> 00:07:15.769
 If Ateneo exercises those rights, it is not to delay or mislead.

00:07:15.769 --> 00:07:19.769
 But simply because that is how it is under our legal system.

00:07:19.769 --> 00:07:33.769
 And if it is eventually found that the university has its shortcomings, please reassure that the university will address them and make them right.

00:07:33.769 --> 00:07:42.769
 While we choose not to immediately broadcast our actions, our commitment on the ground was immediate and full.

00:07:42.769 --> 00:07:48.769
 From day one, the university reached out to provide full support to the families.

00:07:48.769 --> 00:07:56.769
 We offered to shoulder all travel costs of Rinne's family from Agusan to Manila so that they could be with him.

00:07:56.769 --> 00:08:06.769
 While they choose to accept the kind and generous offer of the Agusan Del Sur governor, our hands remain extended.

00:08:06.769 --> 00:08:13.769
 We also are very thankful to Ateneo de Davao University and their president, Father Carl San Juan,

00:08:13.769 --> 00:08:24.769
 with whom we have been in close coordination and since June 8th for their full support and assistance to Baobit's family throughout this time.

00:08:24.769 --> 00:08:33.769
 The university also immediately committed to covering every single expense related to the funeral services and the wake

00:08:33.769 --> 00:08:41.769
 and fully shouldered all costs for the return of the Batarbonia family to Agusan via Davao.

00:08:41.769 --> 00:08:51.769
 Similarly, we have also offered to cover all funeral expenses for divine, including flying his family from Nigeria to the Philippines and back,

00:08:51.769 --> 00:08:58.769
 as well as transportation and expatriation of the body back to his home country.

00:08:59.769 --> 00:09:13.769
 We share these details to assure everyone that we have been working tirelessly to fulfill our duties of care quietly and respectfully where it matters most.

00:09:13.769 --> 00:09:23.769
 So far, all available information and accounts on what happened on June 8th show that it was a tragic accident.

00:09:24.769 --> 00:09:32.769
 But we understand completely that for loved ones, the word accident is never easy to accept.

00:09:32.769 --> 00:09:37.769
 Ateneo de Manila is not evading accountability.

00:09:37.769 --> 00:09:46.769
 For full clarity, transparency, and justice, our Board of Trustees formed an independent, fact-finding body

00:09:46.769 --> 00:09:57.769
 composed of external, highly competent legal and technical experts who will operate entirely outside Ateneo's administrative structure.

00:09:57.769 --> 00:10:07.769
 Their findings and recommendations will be submitted directly to the Board of Trustees, and I assure the public that their review will be exhaustive,

00:10:07.769 --> 00:10:13.769
 unsparing, and free from influence, whether from the inside or outside.

00:10:13.769 --> 00:10:23.769
 We also welcome and will fully cooperate with any and all investigations by civil and regulatory bodies.

00:10:23.769 --> 00:10:28.769
 We are fully committed to the truth wherever it leads.

00:10:28.769 --> 00:10:35.769
 We also recognize our duty to care for the grieving families of Rene and divine.

00:10:35.769 --> 00:10:42.769
 While no amount of material support can ever compensate for the loss of a son,

00:10:42.769 --> 00:10:57.769
 Ateneo has offered full assistance and support to the Adili and Batarbonia families to cover all financial, emotional, and long-term burdens arising from this tragedy.

00:10:57.769 --> 00:11:04.769
 This is not a legal settlement. It is our moral obligation.

00:11:04.769 --> 00:11:18.769
 We would also like to address the increasing distortion of facts circulating in public regarding Ateneo's alleged prior knowledge of safety risks and accusations of institutional intimidation.

00:11:18.769 --> 00:11:32.769
 An initial review of university records show absolutely no complaints, warnings, or communications regarding student safety in this matter, nor was there anyone asked to be silent about this.

00:11:32.769 --> 00:11:48.769
 However, we are not dismissing these serious allegations. All claims and data will be turned over to the independent fact-finding body which will then conduct a rigorous forensic audit of all records and communications.

00:11:48.769 --> 00:11:56.769
 We will not shield or protect anyone, nor will we allow our integrity to be compromised.

00:11:56.769 --> 00:12:11.769
 With this, I also must inform everyone that the university has accepted the resignation of Head Coach Thomas Anthony Ta Baldwin, effective immediately.

00:12:11.769 --> 00:12:16.769
 We thank him for the years of service to the Blue Eagles.

00:12:16.769 --> 00:12:30.769
 But as we enter a period of deep institutional review, a change in leadership is necessary to ensure the full integrity of our sports programs and safety protocols govern them.

00:12:30.769 --> 00:12:45.769
 We must look inward, examine our systems, and rebuild the structures of our athletic programs so that our fields and playing courts remain places where dreams are nurtured, not broken.

00:12:45.769 --> 00:13:12.620
 To the men's basketball program, especially our student athletes, the players, coaching and supporting staff, we also know that you are grieving and in pain, compounded by the relentless misinformation, harsh discourse, and even dangerous threats directed at you.

00:13:12.620 --> 00:13:26.620
 We will continue to support you through this difficult time and will always be committed to your safety and well-being, especially as you also recover from this tragedy.

00:13:26.620 --> 00:13:42.220
 Finally, to the Ateneo community, right now I know that we are all in deep pain with the events of the past week and it has made us all think about our beloved alma mater,

00:13:42.220 --> 00:13:48.220
 the values it stands for, and how we are as a community.

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:57.220
 It is at this moment that we need to come together, to grieve, to reflect, and to heal.

00:13:57.220 --> 00:14:06.220
 We are truly sorry for missteps which have caused further pain to the community and we will work hard to rebuild your trust.

00:14:07.220 --> 00:14:24.220
 As we pray for Rene, divine, and the loved ones they leave behind, I ask you to also pray for healing, clarity, and reflection in our community as we navigate this dark and painful time.

00:14:24.220 --> 00:14:34.620
 Thank you, and we will now open the floor to a brief Q&A session only regarding today's statement.

00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:41.620
 We will now open the floor for a brief question and answer session.

00:14:41.620 --> 00:14:52.620
 To give everyone an opportunity to participate, we ask members of the media to please identify themselves and their organization before asking their question.

00:14:52.620 --> 00:15:01.620
 As much as possible, we request one question and one follow-up question per person.

00:15:02.620 --> 00:15:07.620
 We will begin with questions related to the statement that has been delivered.

00:15:07.620 --> 00:15:17.539
 You may now approach any of the mics.

00:15:17.539 --> 00:15:20.539
 Hello, Naveen Ganglani of All Star Magazine.

00:15:20.539 --> 00:15:26.539
 In addition to Coach Tab Baldwin, team manager Epokimpa was also on a leave of absence.

00:15:26.539 --> 00:15:34.539
 Just confirming, has the team manager also submitted his desire to resign from his post?

00:15:34.539 --> 00:15:37.539
 Emily also no longer be with the team. Thank you very much.

00:15:38.539 --> 00:15:53.019
 Yes, team manager Epokimpa has also submitted his resignation and we have also accepted it.

00:15:53.019 --> 00:15:59.019
 Hi, good afternoon. Ian Suyu from TV5. First question, sir. Father Bobby.

00:16:00.019 --> 00:16:06.019
 Do you know or how long have you been working on this kind of program?

00:16:06.019 --> 00:16:13.019
 The coaching staff or the men's basketball team has been working on this kind of program.

00:16:13.019 --> 00:16:20.019
 This kind of military-like, as they said, ex-players or previous players.

00:16:20.019 --> 00:16:24.019
 Have we received this kind of information before?

00:16:24.019 --> 00:16:28.019
 And if ever, how long have you been working on this kind of program?

00:16:28.019 --> 00:16:36.809
 As far as I know, the team-building that they have been working on,

00:16:36.809 --> 00:16:42.809
 this happened during the time of Norman Black, even though he is still a coach.

00:16:42.809 --> 00:16:54.809
 Even though he is a coach, I know that there are four or five visits to Aurora.

00:16:54.809 --> 00:17:01.809
 They have five visits to Aurora. So, this is a tradition that only happened during the pandemic.

00:17:01.809 --> 00:17:13.599
 There is a week when they go there and do team-building and training and conditioning, etc.

00:17:13.599 --> 00:17:21.599
 And I know Coach Tab has already resigned from his post, but just want to get your reaction.

00:17:21.599 --> 00:17:27.599
 Father Bobby, about the allegations, particularly concerning about Coach Tab's throne,

00:17:27.599 --> 00:17:33.599
 or said by her estranged wife and step-daughter recently circulating on social media?

00:17:33.599 --> 00:17:49.910
 We don't have direct information so far. In fact, there was never any, as far as we know.

00:17:50.910 --> 00:17:53.910
 Thank you very much.

00:17:53.910 --> 00:17:59.289
 May we have the next question, please? Yes, go ahead.

00:17:59.289 --> 00:18:03.289
 Hi, I'm a student of the Neo de Manila and a member of a student publication.

00:18:03.289 --> 00:18:11.289
 Could you tell us more about the safety protocols currently in place, including the parental notification form and the declaration and undertaking forms?

00:18:11.289 --> 00:18:18.009
 We reserve that to that group that will be investigating everything.

00:18:19.009 --> 00:18:25.009
 As a student, you know all the forms required for any activity outside of campus. That's real.

00:18:25.009 --> 00:18:31.009
 But you want to make sure that the audit is exhaustive.

00:18:31.009 --> 00:18:38.009
 May we just go back to the earlier reminder that we said that some matters remain under review.

00:18:38.009 --> 00:18:40.009
 That will be reviewed.

00:18:40.009 --> 00:18:43.009
 Thank you.

00:18:43.009 --> 00:18:48.440
 Next question, please.

00:18:48.440 --> 00:18:51.440
 Hi, Father.

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:56.440
 Father, you mentioned earlier that Tab Baldwin was resigning and you accepted it.

00:18:56.440 --> 00:19:00.440
 Does that mean that he's on his own?

00:19:00.440 --> 00:19:05.440
 Like earlier, he's not on his way to the IDG in Sabina.

00:19:05.440 --> 00:19:08.440
 What's the reason for that?

00:19:08.440 --> 00:19:10.440
 Have you talked to him about that?

00:19:10.440 --> 00:19:17.440
 And even all the players, because even the players are on their way to Sabina, Sir M. Fernandez.

00:19:18.440 --> 00:19:27.440
 I think Coach Tab is the best person to ask about why he resigned.

00:19:27.440 --> 00:19:34.440
 He did not go to the IDG, so please ask him about it.

00:19:34.440 --> 00:19:39.440
 I think he's the proper person to answer. I cannot speak for him.

00:19:40.440 --> 00:19:47.440
 You mentioned earlier that the players are resigning.

00:19:47.440 --> 00:19:55.440
 The resigning is our university athletic director and some coaches.

00:19:55.440 --> 00:19:58.440
 The players are resigning.

00:19:58.440 --> 00:20:01.440
 Earlier, they were supposed to appear.

00:20:01.440 --> 00:20:06.960
 Yes.

00:20:06.960 --> 00:20:08.960
 Please introduce yourself.

00:20:08.960 --> 00:20:09.960
 Hi, Father. Good day, Brian.

00:20:10.960 --> 00:20:16.960
 Father, yesterday, Field Oil announced that Athenaeus withdrawn from the tournament.

00:20:16.960 --> 00:20:26.960
 Will there be some kind of similar withdrawal from the UAP or leave of absence or anything?

00:20:26.960 --> 00:20:29.960
 Have you talked about that?

00:20:29.960 --> 00:20:35.589
 The withdrawal of Field Oil, I hope you understand that.

00:20:35.589 --> 00:20:38.589
 Divine has been here for a whole week.

00:20:38.589 --> 00:20:41.589
 Our players have been here for a week.

00:20:41.589 --> 00:20:43.589
 In fact, they are in deep grief.

00:20:43.589 --> 00:20:47.589
 So it doesn't make sense to let them play.

00:20:47.589 --> 00:20:50.589
 The UAP has no decision.

00:20:50.589 --> 00:20:53.589
 We have not studied that yet.

00:20:53.589 --> 00:20:57.589
 But there is no decision on what to do.

00:20:57.589 --> 00:21:02.589
 The UAP has a statement on the board.

00:21:02.589 --> 00:21:05.589
 We will follow up.

00:21:05.589 --> 00:21:08.589
 Yes, Father.

00:21:08.589 --> 00:21:15.589
 With the removal of Coach Tab and our resignation of Coach Tab and Sir Epoch,

00:21:15.589 --> 00:21:17.589
 how about the coaching staff?

00:21:17.589 --> 00:21:20.589
 Is there a total rebound or will the coaching staff stay?

00:21:20.589 --> 00:21:23.589
 The two have been resigning.

00:21:23.589 --> 00:21:30.589
 In fact, the coaching staff has been helping us.

00:21:30.589 --> 00:21:33.589
 They are also in the grieving process.

00:21:33.589 --> 00:21:38.589
 We are providing as much support for them as they grieve this tragedy.

00:21:38.589 --> 00:21:40.589
 They will continue.

00:21:40.589 --> 00:21:43.589
 There is no rebound of any sort.

00:21:43.589 --> 00:21:44.589
 They will continue.

00:21:44.589 --> 00:21:47.589
 We hope that after a few weeks,

00:21:47.589 --> 00:21:52.589
 in fact, they can supervise the practices of the team.

00:21:52.589 --> 00:21:54.589
 Thank you, Father.

00:21:54.589 --> 00:21:56.589
 Yes, please.

00:21:56.589 --> 00:22:00.059
 Go ahead.

00:22:00.059 --> 00:22:03.059
 Mark Salazar of GMA News, Father Bobby.

00:22:03.059 --> 00:22:05.059
 Can you narrate, Father,

00:22:05.059 --> 00:22:10.059
 what was your earliest communication with René's family?

00:22:10.059 --> 00:22:15.059
 Initially, his mother was saying there was no coordination,

00:22:15.059 --> 00:22:18.059
 there was no reach out from Ateneo,

00:22:18.059 --> 00:22:23.059
 there was no connection from Aurora back to Manila.

00:22:23.059 --> 00:22:25.059
 These things, his frustration,

00:22:25.059 --> 00:22:28.059
 there was no presence of Ateneo.

00:22:28.059 --> 00:22:32.059
 If you can narrate to the point or as early as what point

00:22:32.059 --> 00:22:35.059
 Ateneo was talking to his family,

00:22:35.059 --> 00:22:40.059
 what kind of assistance were given to them to explain?

00:22:40.059 --> 00:22:48.420
 I can say that there was somebody from Ateneo

00:22:48.420 --> 00:22:52.420
 who spoke to her on the very night it happened.

00:22:52.420 --> 00:22:56.420
 I would like to respect the dignity

00:22:56.420 --> 00:22:59.420
 and the very difficulty of the situation,

00:22:59.420 --> 00:23:04.420
 so I don't want to give details of that conversation.

00:23:04.420 --> 00:23:10.420
 We were the ones who arranged that they be picked up

00:23:10.420 --> 00:23:15.420
 right away from Aurora and be brought back to Manila.

00:23:15.420 --> 00:23:18.420
 In fact, by the evening of that day,

00:23:18.420 --> 00:23:20.420
 there was already an ambulance that came

00:23:20.420 --> 00:23:23.420
 and we arranged all of that.

00:23:23.420 --> 00:23:28.420
 In our case, as I mentioned, we offered to fly

00:23:28.420 --> 00:23:31.420
 and then they chose the Agusan Governor,

00:23:31.420 --> 00:23:35.420
 which is very understandable and we walked with the LGU.

00:23:35.420 --> 00:23:38.420
 We have tried to reach out for and as we said,

00:23:38.420 --> 00:23:42.420
 we did try to support as much as we can for the wake,

00:23:42.420 --> 00:23:46.420
 for the care of the family during this situation

00:23:46.420 --> 00:23:49.420
 and we continue to show it by our sister university

00:23:49.420 --> 00:23:54.180
 that ended up out.

00:23:54.180 --> 00:23:59.490
 We'll take two or three more questions.

00:23:59.490 --> 00:24:00.490
 Yes?

00:24:00.490 --> 00:24:03.490
 Ma'am Gabriel Lalo from Inquirer.

00:24:03.490 --> 00:24:06.490
 Earlier, there was also a discussion

00:24:06.490 --> 00:24:09.490
 about why the statement was not released,

00:24:10.490 --> 00:24:14.490
 but do you think it's a fault

00:24:14.490 --> 00:24:18.490
 or a mistake that you should have updated the public as well?

00:24:18.490 --> 00:24:20.490
 Because there were a lot of questions

00:24:20.490 --> 00:24:24.490
 which led to assumptions and misinformation

00:24:24.490 --> 00:24:28.490
 and speculations regarding what happened.

00:24:28.490 --> 00:24:35.380
 The Atheneo family was the first one admittedly.

00:24:35.380 --> 00:24:39.390
 We didn't take the initiative.

00:24:39.390 --> 00:24:41.390
 A lot of things were released back then

00:24:41.390 --> 00:24:45.390
 but it wasn't like that because we respected the family.

00:24:45.390 --> 00:24:48.390
 A lot of things happened,

00:24:48.390 --> 00:24:53.440
 a lot of things were difficult to say.

00:24:53.440 --> 00:24:56.440
 So there was a lot of confusion

00:24:56.440 --> 00:24:59.440
 especially regarding the likes of the family.

00:24:59.440 --> 00:25:03.440
 It's good that we gave our friends the data about it.

00:25:03.440 --> 00:25:10.299
 They know it better.

00:25:10.299 --> 00:25:14.299
 I was just saying that when Mrs. Baturbonia came,

00:25:14.299 --> 00:25:16.299
 I was there.

00:25:16.299 --> 00:25:18.299
 I was there in Arlington.

00:25:18.299 --> 00:25:20.299
 I rented her to the room

00:25:20.299 --> 00:25:22.299
 and the room was already there.

00:25:22.299 --> 00:25:26.299
 I won't tell you what happened in the room.

00:25:26.299 --> 00:25:28.299
 But I was there personally.

00:25:28.299 --> 00:25:31.299
 I was there as if I was being treated

00:25:31.299 --> 00:25:33.299
 and treated as a kind of a company.

00:25:33.299 --> 00:25:38.299
 So we didn't want

00:25:38.299 --> 00:25:41.299
 the attention we had to provide them,

00:25:41.299 --> 00:25:45.299
 the consolation and the decency of grieving.

00:25:45.299 --> 00:25:52.890
 I don't want to describe the details of what happened.

00:25:52.890 --> 00:25:54.890
 Yes, and then you'll be next.

00:25:54.890 --> 00:25:56.890
 She just lies a bit on our news.

00:25:56.890 --> 00:26:01.890
 Can we confirm who or who were in the team building in Aurora?

00:26:01.890 --> 00:26:08.700
 We said earlier that there was an independent.

00:26:08.700 --> 00:26:11.700
 We don't want to compromise the findings of that.

00:26:11.700 --> 00:26:14.700
 Even we, the whole university will be answerable

00:26:14.700 --> 00:26:16.700
 to that fact finding group.

00:26:16.700 --> 00:26:18.700
 So we don't want to preempt any of...

00:26:18.700 --> 00:26:20.700
 Please limit it to the state.

00:26:20.700 --> 00:26:21.700
 Thank you.

00:26:21.700 --> 00:26:23.700
 We'll take the last question.

00:26:23.700 --> 00:26:24.700
 Yes.

00:26:24.700 --> 00:26:25.700
 Good afternoon, Benjamin.

00:26:25.700 --> 00:26:26.700
 Sorry, are you queued up?

00:26:26.700 --> 00:26:27.700
 No.

00:26:27.700 --> 00:26:28.700
 Okay.

00:26:28.700 --> 00:26:29.700
 We'll take last two questions.

00:26:29.700 --> 00:26:30.700
 Okay.

00:26:30.700 --> 00:26:31.700
 Thank you very much.

00:26:31.700 --> 00:26:32.700
 Thank you.

00:26:32.700 --> 00:26:34.700
 Good afternoon, Benjamin Hakob of the Gaiden.

00:26:34.700 --> 00:26:36.700
 You mentioned earlier that there will be

00:26:36.700 --> 00:26:38.700
 an independent investigation that will be performed

00:26:38.700 --> 00:26:40.700
 outside of the Atinae administration.

00:26:40.700 --> 00:26:44.700
 Who exactly will be conducting this investigation?

00:26:44.700 --> 00:26:48.299
 As I said in my statement, it will be conducted

00:26:48.299 --> 00:26:52.299
 by reputable legal and technical experts

00:26:52.299 --> 00:26:54.299
 who are not part of the administration.

00:26:54.299 --> 00:26:57.299
 But that investigation is internal.

00:26:57.299 --> 00:27:00.299
 It was mandated by our Board of Trustees.

00:27:00.299 --> 00:27:01.299
 Thank you.

00:27:01.299 --> 00:27:02.299
 Thank you.

00:27:02.299 --> 00:27:04.299
 One last.

00:27:04.299 --> 00:27:06.299
 Good afternoon, Pope.

00:27:06.299 --> 00:27:11.299
 I have one swing of daily tribune for Father Bobby Pope.

00:27:11.299 --> 00:27:13.299
 I would like to ask them, Pope.

00:27:13.299 --> 00:27:16.299
 I know that everything is still being investigated,

00:27:16.299 --> 00:27:20.299
 but what is the time frame on independent

00:27:20.299 --> 00:27:22.299
 finding of Atinaeo?

00:27:22.299 --> 00:27:31.720
 What we are saying is that at least two weeks

00:27:31.720 --> 00:27:36.720
 are needed because it is really thorough and exhaustive.

00:27:36.720 --> 00:27:39.720
 Even if we are in the administration,

00:27:39.720 --> 00:27:42.720
 even if we are coaching staff,

00:27:42.720 --> 00:27:48.720
 all of them will call and talk to us.

00:27:48.720 --> 00:27:51.720
 They will say at least two weeks, maybe more.

00:27:51.720 --> 00:27:53.720
 I don't want to give a deadline because

00:27:53.720 --> 00:27:57.720
 they might say that they can't do that.

00:27:57.720 --> 00:28:01.720
 But we are trying to do it as comprehensively

00:28:01.720 --> 00:28:05.720
 as possible and as quickly as possible.

00:28:05.720 --> 00:28:08.319
 Thank you.

00:28:08.319 --> 00:28:09.319
 Last two.

00:28:09.319 --> 00:28:10.319
 Thank you.

00:28:10.319 --> 00:28:13.319
 Good afternoon, John Marquesia from spin.ph.

00:28:14.319 --> 00:28:17.319
 Atinaeo de Davao extended scholarship offers

00:28:17.319 --> 00:28:19.319
 to the families of Rene.

00:28:19.319 --> 00:28:22.319
 We would like to ask at the end of Atinaeo de Manila

00:28:22.319 --> 00:28:24.319
 what would be the assistance provided

00:28:24.319 --> 00:28:27.319
 by the university to the families?

00:28:27.319 --> 00:28:30.750
 Thank you.

00:28:30.750 --> 00:28:33.750
 As I said in my statement,

00:28:33.750 --> 00:28:38.750
 we will provide material assistance

00:28:38.750 --> 00:28:40.750
 to the families.

00:28:40.750 --> 00:28:44.750
 We see that not as a form of legal settlement,

00:28:44.750 --> 00:28:48.750
 but that is really a form of our moral responsibility.

00:28:48.750 --> 00:28:52.750
 And I would like to again keep,

00:28:52.750 --> 00:28:54.750
 I don't want to list out all the details

00:28:54.750 --> 00:28:56.750
 of what we are talking,

00:28:56.750 --> 00:28:58.750
 but we are presently in communication with them

00:28:58.750 --> 00:29:00.750
 about the assistance.

00:29:00.750 --> 00:29:03.750
 And it will be also an assistance

00:29:03.750 --> 00:29:06.750
 that will cover a time

00:29:06.750 --> 00:29:08.750
 that will really support them

00:29:08.750 --> 00:29:13.750
 for the needs for a good period of time.

00:29:14.750 --> 00:29:16.750
 Just the last follow-up, to the extent

00:29:16.750 --> 00:29:18.750
 that you may only disclose,

00:29:18.750 --> 00:29:21.750
 during the time that Atinaeo wasn't speaking

00:29:21.750 --> 00:29:22.750
 about the issue,

00:29:22.750 --> 00:29:24.750
 can you take us through the conversations

00:29:24.750 --> 00:29:26.750
 that you had with Coach Tab

00:29:26.750 --> 00:29:28.750
 in terms of when to speak out

00:29:28.750 --> 00:29:31.750
 and when to at least issue a public statement?

00:29:31.750 --> 00:29:34.750
 Just a brief timeline of how it went down.

00:29:34.750 --> 00:29:37.750
 As I said, in terms of Coach Tab,

00:29:37.750 --> 00:29:39.750
 you can really just ask him.

00:29:39.750 --> 00:29:41.750
 I would like to keep that also,

00:29:41.750 --> 00:29:43.750
 respect the confidentiality of Coach Tab.

00:29:43.750 --> 00:29:47.750
 So please ask him if it's about it.

00:29:47.750 --> 00:29:49.750
 Thank you very much.

00:29:49.750 --> 00:29:51.750
 We'll take one last question, final question.

00:29:51.750 --> 00:29:52.750
 Thank you.

00:29:52.750 --> 00:29:55.750
 Good afternoon, Andrea Taginas from ADSEBN.

00:29:55.750 --> 00:29:58.750
 You mentioned, Father, that you're looking into

00:29:58.750 --> 00:30:01.750
 if there were prior warnings given

00:30:01.750 --> 00:30:03.750
 if it was dangerous to go in

00:30:03.750 --> 00:30:06.750
 the activity during that time.

00:30:06.750 --> 00:30:09.750
 But I believe there are past interviews

00:30:09.750 --> 00:30:12.750
 from former Blue Eagles

00:30:12.750 --> 00:30:15.750
 saying, describing how intense the training was,

00:30:15.750 --> 00:30:17.750
 someone almost drowned.

00:30:17.750 --> 00:30:20.750
 Were the previous years

00:30:20.750 --> 00:30:23.750
 not being red flagged for the university

00:30:23.750 --> 00:30:29.750
 to look into the nature of the training camp?

00:30:29.750 --> 00:30:32.750
 Those very things are within really the ambit

00:30:32.750 --> 00:30:34.750
 and the concern of the independent

00:30:34.750 --> 00:30:37.750
 fact-finding board, the independent panel.

00:30:37.750 --> 00:30:41.750
 So let us give the time to the independent panel

00:30:41.750 --> 00:30:43.750
 to establish those things.

00:30:43.750 --> 00:30:44.750
 Okay.

00:30:44.750 --> 00:30:45.750
 All right.

00:30:45.750 --> 00:30:47.750
 Maraming salamat po.

00:30:47.750 --> 00:30:49.750
 On behalf of Ataneda MLA University,

00:30:49.750 --> 00:30:51.750
 we thank the members of the media

00:30:51.750 --> 00:30:54.750
 for your presence and your professionalism.

00:30:54.750 --> 00:30:56.750
 We also thank the public for their patience

00:30:56.750 --> 00:30:58.750
 and as we continue to grieve,

00:30:58.750 --> 00:31:00.750
 support the families,

00:31:00.750 --> 00:31:01.750
 co-operate all investigations

00:31:01.750 --> 00:31:03.750
 and pursue the truth with honesty,

00:31:03.750 --> 00:31:05.750
 accountability and compassion.

00:31:05.750 --> 00:31:07.750
 We ask that you continue to keep the families

00:31:07.750 --> 00:31:09.750
 of Bobbitt and Divine,

00:31:09.750 --> 00:31:11.750
 their loved ones, teammates, coaches

00:31:11.750 --> 00:31:13.750
 and friends and your prayers.

